window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-038-6a55541596dcdade.json"]={sha256:"6a55541596dcdade40feb76983900e2da124770a1eaa0d351a78d741b2add136",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-597cb4354f2dd909","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-021-03318-4","title":"Demonstration of the trapped-ion quantum CCD computer architecture","titleEn":"Demonstration of the trapped-ion quantum CCD computer architecture","publisher":"Pino et al., Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-038","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-038","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-039","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-021-03318-4"],"title":"Quantinuum 多區離子阱：運輸資源排程","titleEn":"Quantinuum multizone ion trap: transport-resource scheduling","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付位置／速度／加速度圖及到位／加熱雙驗收表。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver position/velocity/acceleration plots and separate arrival/heating acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Quantinuum 多區離子阱：運輸資源排程』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付離子身分追蹤、資源衝突圖與截止時間驗收。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Quantinuum multizone ion trap: transport-resource scheduling', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver ion identity tracking, a resource-conflict graph and deadline acceptance.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：對稱加速／減速三角速度代理，距離L=aT²/4，所以a=4L/T²；不是避免加熱的實際波形。 使用教學L=200 μm、T=100 μs；僅分析運動學與時間預算。 以手算或試算表計算名義式4*200e-6/(100e-6)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：積分三角速度面積應為200 μm；計算v峰=aT/2核對距離。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：教學一輪時間T=N批(t移動+t門)；批內互不衝突的工作可並行，共用路口仍需序列化。 使用假想8個工作、2個獨立區，4批；每批移動50 μs、門100 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式4*(50+100)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：畫甘特圖並確認同一離子不能同時出現在兩區；逐格檢查共用路口，不能僅用8除區數。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For a symmetric triangular-velocity proxy, L=aT²/4, so a=4L/T²; it is not a real low-heating transport waveform. Use Teaching L=200 μm and T=100 μs; analyze kinematics and timing only. Evaluate nominal expression 4*200e-6/(100e-6)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Integrate triangular velocity to200 μm; use peak velocity aT/2 to cross-check distance.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Teaching round time T=Nbatch(tmove+tgate); conflict-free jobs can run in parallel but shared junctions require serialization. Use Synthetic8 jobs on2 independent zones require4 batches; each has50 μs movement and100 μs gates. Evaluate nominal expression 4*(50+100) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Draw a Gantt chart; one ion cannot occupy two zones at once. Check junction occupancy instead of merely dividing8 by zone count.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-048","referenceUrls":["https://atom-computing.com/quantum-computing-technology/"],"title":"Atom Computing 核自旋控制：相位噪聲對比","titleEn":"Atom Computing nuclear-spin control: phase-noise contrast","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付位置／速度／加速度圖及到位／加熱雙驗收表。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver position/velocity/acceleration plots and separate arrival/heating acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Atom Computing 核自旋控制：相位噪聲對比』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付相位分布、兩正交分量與小噪聲近似誤差表。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Atom Computing nuclear-spin control: phase-noise contrast', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver phase distributions, coherence quadratures and small-noise approximation errors.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：對稱加速／減速三角速度代理，距離L=aT²/4，所以a=4L/T²；不是避免加熱的實際波形。 使用教學L=200 μm、T=100 μs；僅分析運動學與時間預算。 以手算或試算表計算名義式4*200e-6/(100e-6)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：積分三角速度面積應為200 μm；計算v峰=aT/2核對距離。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：若相位誤差零均值Gaussian、RMS為σφ，平均相干對比C=exp(−σφ²/2)；固定相位偏差需另外校正。 使用教學σφ=0.2 rad；相位是弧度，不能直接代入角度值。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-0.2**2/2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以小σ近似1−σ²/2交叉檢查，列出精確與近似殘差，不將近似外推σ=3。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For a symmetric triangular-velocity proxy, L=aT²/4, so a=4L/T²; it is not a real low-heating transport waveform. Use Teaching L=200 μm and T=100 μs; analyze kinematics and timing only. Evaluate nominal expression 4*200e-6/(100e-6)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Integrate triangular velocity to200 μm; use peak velocity aT/2 to cross-check distance.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For zero-mean Gaussian phase error with RMS σφ, averaged coherence contrast C=exp(−σφ²/2); fixed phase bias needs separate correction. Use Teaching σφ=0.2 rad; phase is in radians, not numerical degrees. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-0.2**2/2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Cross-check with1−σ²/2 for small σ, record residuals and do not extrapolate to σ=3.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-597cb4354f2dd909","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-021-03318-4","title":"Demonstration of the trapped-ion quantum CCD computer architecture","titleEn":"Demonstration of the trapped-ion quantum CCD computer architecture","publisher":"Pino et al., Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-9e8cba3a789ff3a4","url":"https://atom-computing.com/quantum-computing-technology/","title":"Quantum Computing Technology","titleEn":"Quantum Computing Technology","publisher":"Atom Computing","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
